<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86923" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προγυμν-άζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>exercise, train beforehand,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χέρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					498
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτὸν ἐς ἄλλον βίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Herm.</u>
					78
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>VP</u>
				47
			</span></i>: esp. <i>train in oratory,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				1.26.13
			</span></i>, etc.:—
				Med.
			, <i>study, practise oneself,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>Anim.Pass.</u>
				2.3
			</span></i>; but also, <i>act as</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προγυμναστής</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					2
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				6.177
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, of arguments or passages, <i>to be prepared beforehand,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ προγυμνασθέντες λόγοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hermog.
					<u>Inv.</u>
					4.12
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
